st name is Gonzales. Let's get the live call booked for tomorrow afternoon.\nAgent: Got it, Maria Gonzales. And what’s the name of your practice or company?\nUser: The name of my practice is Bright Smile Dental. Let's book that live call for tomorrow.\nAgent: So… tomorrow’s actually fully booked, but I can get you in the next day, Wednesday the 26th. Would 1:00 pm or 1:45 pm Central work better for you?\nUser: Let's book the live call for Wednesday, the 26th, at 1:00 pm Central.\nAgent: One moment while I confirm that.\nAgent: Thanks, Maria — you’re all set for Wednesday the 26th at 1:00 pm Central. You’ll get a text message with the confirmation details so you can add it to your calendar or reschedule if you need to. Is there anything else I can help you with before we wrap up?",
